[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=OpenOLEDShifter
Comment=Configure OLED wallpaper pixel shifting
Comment[zh_CN]=配置 OLED 壁纸像素位移
Comment[zh_TW]=設定 OLED 桌布像素位移
Comment[zh_HK]=設定 OLED 桌布像素位移
Comment[zh_MO]=設定 OLED 桌布像素位移
Exec=/usr/lib/openoledshifter/OpenOLEDShifter
Icon=org.openoledshifter.Desktop
StartupWMClass=OpenOLEDShifter
Terminal=false
Categories=Utility;
Keywords=OLED;Wallpaper;Pixel shifting;
